*> Gaussian process regression on iris: Petal.Length ~ Petal.Width, with
*> posterior confidence intervals in and far outside the training range.
*> CMD: just TARGET=gaussian_process_iris_ex run-cobol
*> (The name is shortened because GnuCOBOL limits source names to 31 characters.)
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-IRIS-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

01 FORMULA-TEXT PIC X(40) VALUE "Petal.Length ~ Petal.Width".
01 QUERY-DATA.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.2.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.3.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 2.5.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 10.0.
01 QUERY-WIDTHS REDEFINES QUERY-DATA.
   05 QUERY-WIDTH USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 4.

01 IRIS      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 MODEL     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 QUERY     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 FRAME     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PLOT      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 I         USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 INT-1     PIC -(9)9.
01 INT-2     PIC -(9)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "dm_data_iris" USING DM-DATA-IRIS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-IRIS-RESULT TO IRIS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_nrows" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-RESULT TO INT-1
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_ncols" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS-RESULT TO INT-2
    DISPLAY "iris: " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-1) " rows x " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-2) " cols"
    DISPLAY "formula: " FUNCTION TRIM(FORMULA-TEXT)
    DISPLAY " "

    *> The length scale and noise ratio are auto-selected by maximizing the
    *> exact log marginal likelihood.
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-NEW-DATA
    MOVE FORMULA-TEXT TO DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-NEW-FORMULA
    CALL "dm_gaussian_process_regression_new" USING DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-NEW-RESULT TO MODEL
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PRINT-SUMMARY-SELF
    CALL "dm_gaussian_process_regression_print_summary" USING
        DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PRINT-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    MOVE MODEL TO DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PLOT-FIT-SELF
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PLOT-FIT-DATA
    CALL "dm_gaussian_process_regression_plot_fit" USING
        DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PLOT-FIT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PLOT-FIT-RESULT TO PLOT
    MOVE "gpr_iris_fit.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-PLOT
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-GSSN-PRCSS-REGRESSION-PLOT-LENGTH-SCALE-PROFILE-SELF
    CALL "dm_gssn_process_regression_plot_length_scale_profile" USING
        DM-GSSN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PLOT-LENGTH-SCALE-PROFILE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GSSN-PRCSS-RGRSSN-PLOT-LENGTH-SCALE-PROFILE-RESULT TO PLOT
    MOVE "gpr_iris_length_scale_profile.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-PLOT
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Saved gpr_iris_fit.svg and gpr_iris_length_scale_profile.svg"

    *> A GP gives a genuine posterior confidence interval at every point,
    *> widening far outside the training data.
    CALL "dm_data_frame_new" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW-RESULT TO QUERY
    MOVE 4 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 4
        MOVE QUERY-WIDTH(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    CALL "dm_vector_double_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE QUERY TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-SELF
    MOVE "Petal.Width" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-VALUES
    CALL "dm_data_frame_add_numeric_column" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    MOVE MODEL TO DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PREDICT-FRAME-SELF
    MOVE QUERY TO DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PREDICT-FRAME-NEWDATA
    MOVE 2 TO DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PREDICT-FRAME-GIVEN
    MOVE "confidence" TO DM-GSSN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PREDICT-FRAME-INTERVAL-KIND
    CALL "dm_gaussian_process_regression_predict_frame" USING
        DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PREDICT-FRAME DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PREDICT-FRAME-RESULT TO FRAME
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Predictions with 95% confidence intervals:"
    MOVE FRAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_to_string" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    DISPLAY DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-RESULT-LENGTH)
    DISPLAY "(Petal.Width=10.0 is far outside the training range [0.1, 2.5] -- note how much wider its"
    DISPLAY " interval is than the in-range predictions.)"

    MOVE FRAME TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE QUERY TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.

*> Saves PLOT to DM-PLOT-SAVE-PATH and closes it.
SAVE-PLOT.
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SELF
    CALL "dm_plot_save" USING DM-PLOT-SAVE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
